Description: Multi-tier DDoS mitigation engine for Linux game servers
 XDP/eBPF, nftables and nfqueue L7 inspection tiers for Source/CS2/Rust
 game servers, with a GeoIP and datacenter ASN filter and a systemd-managed
 daemon.
 .
 Durations, ports and trust lists are configured in /etc/femboi/firewall.conf.
